$V(x_{t+1}) - V(x_t) \le -\alpha V(x_t) + \beta\|w_t\|^2$ with $\alpha > 0$.

Cosmos-Harmony constitutes a complete, mathematically rigorous, cryptographically
secure, and empirically demonstrated autonomous planetary intelligence system.
\end{abstract}